"""What the special-use ores do (phase 3). Generated by build_ores.py into fuel, brewing, recipes, trades and gear-set
(off-hand focus) data, and into pipican/ores.json for the Java hooks (com.pipican.ore.SpecialOreEvents).

Systems:
  FUEL       furnace burn time in ticks (coal is 1600)
  BREWS      awkward potion + ore -> potion; AMPLIFIER / EXTENDER turn any potion into its strong / long version
  CONSUME    right-click to use up: effects (effect, seconds, level) and/or a custom action handled in Java
  COATINGS   anvil: gear + 1 ore -> coated gear ("weapon", "helmet", "armor" or "shield"); effects in Java
  FOCUS      held in the off hand: class-spec lines (like set bonuses)
  BLOCKS     what the ore's storage block does: sunstone (undead keep away), sekkiseki (no teleporting nearby),
             kairoseki (no abilities nearby), unbreakable
  RECIPES    extra crafting / smelting recipes
  TRADES     (ore, count) -> emeralds: wandering traders and a profession buy them
  EXTRA_ITEMS  new items an ore turns into (Cinnabar -> Mercury)
Later phases: upgrade materials (Titanite, Raritanium, Eridium, Materia, Zonaite), world mechanics (Tiberium,
Warpstone, Quantanium, Element Zero, Dilithium, SAM), Allomancy metals, limited T8/T9 materials.
"""

